   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\">\n  <li>Answer the following questions about functions <span data-math=\"f(x)\">f(x)</span> and <span data-math=\"g(x)\">g(x)</span>.</li>\n</ol><br>  <ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n    <li>What type of expression is <span data-math=\"f(x)=1.5^x\">f(x)=1.5^x</span>?</li>\n  </ol>",
